WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.200
On many city bikes,

c2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.200
the chain hides inside

c3
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.800
a closed chain guard.

c4
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.964
The front gear has

c5
00:00:04.964 --> 00:00:05.545
forty-eight teeth;

c6
00:00:05.545 --> 00:00:06.709
the rear gear has

c7
00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:07.600
sixteen.

c8
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600
So one turn of

c9
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600
the pedals turns the

c10
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.200
rear wheel three times.

